# DsButtonV3 docs snippets

## Default

### Show code
<DsButtonV3
  color="default"
  icon="check_circle"
  onClick={() => {}}
  size="medium"
  variant="primary"
>
  Button
</DsButtonV3>

### MCP manifest
const Default = () => <DsButtonV3
    onClick={fn()}
    color="default"
    variant="primary"
    size="medium"
    icon="check_circle">Button</DsButtonV3>;

